# Cloudflare Pages security headers for the admin panel.
#
# Audit context: the 2026-05-20 CSP header audit (internal notes)
# (TIER 5 security pass, 2026-05-20).
#
# The admin panel is gated behind Cloudflare Access (per V-135) but
# defense-in-depth still applies: even authenticated staff sessions
# benefit from clickjacking + MIME-sniffing + Referrer defaults.
#
# CSP is enforced after the family-wide runtime-origin audit. Inline
# application code remains allowed; remote scripts and unlisted network
# destinations are blocked. See the 2026-05-20 CSP header audit notes.

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/*.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/*.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# ── Security headers — applies to every path ─────────────────────────
# Strict-Transport-Security: force HTTPS (the panel reads ds_web_session_token
#   from localStorage); matches the API's HSTS. Added 2026-06-03 — CF-Pages
#   edge served no STS header here (verified live). preload directive advisory;
#   apex hstspreload.org submission is a separate founder/infra step.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; frame-src 'none'; form-action 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://api.driftstack.dev; manifest-src 'self'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
